# NabhaCare Connect — frontend environment
#
# Copy to .env if you need to override anything. Most users need nothing here:
# the app talks to the backend on its own origin and Vite proxies /api to
# http://localhost:5000 in development (see vite.config.ts).
#
# There is deliberately no VITE_BACKEND_URL. The previous .env set it to a LAN
# address (http://10.51.5.1:5000), and components that read it sent login
# requests to that host, so OTP login failed when running on localhost.

# Supabase is no longer used by the browser. Appointments, health records and
# profiles are served by the backend from its own database.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=